'''Vendor El''' (売り子エル ''Uriko Eru'', '''Vendor El''') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy introduced in [[A Cultured Festival]]. It was added in [[Version 5.5 Update|Version 5.5]].

