==Enemy==
A bigger [[Chickful A]] wearing a carnival fryer. It has a faster attack rate than its normal counterpart, but it is much weaker and has less range. It is also slightly faster and has only two knockbacks instead of three. Unlike Chickful A, it is not an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemy. It also has a 50% chance to reduce your cats' attack power by 50%. Not too much of a problem alone, but can be a huge threat when stacked and buffed. Bring cats that outrange it such as [[Salon Cat (Rare Cat)|Paris Cat]] to deal damage to it, and use [[:Category:Nuker-class Cats|nukers]] such as [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]] to deal with huge hordes.

