==Trivia==
*Prior to [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]], when all [[:Category:Event Enemies|event enemies]] were added to the [[Enemy Guide]], Vendor El was named "Chicka Fry" in the event poster for [[A Cultured Festival]].
*Vendor El's name is derived from the Japanese name of [[Chickful A]], Angel Hioko<u>el</u> (天使ヒオコエル ''Tenshi Hiokoeru'').

